# v1 source code: kept locally for the FastAPI extension backend, but not
# shipped in this repo so the public version focuses on v2. The v1 result
# JSONs (models/cv_results.json, models/results.json) and the precomputed
# v1 figures (notebooks/figures/) ARE tracked, so the v1 row in the README
# stays citeable. Anchored to root so we don't accidentally untrack
# extension/src/ which is the Chrome extension source.
